{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3058","id":4556135629,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAABD5EczQ","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3058","diff_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3058.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3058.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3058","number":3058,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Show the guest's stderr when a backend launch fails its status assertion","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[hermit2, recon-2, claude-opus-5, devbig014, role=impl]\n\nPlain Language Summary and Project Impact: three backend dispatch tests assert\nthe guest's exit status with a bare `assert_eq!` and no message, so a failure\nprints `left: Exited(255) right: Exited(0)` and nothing else. The guest's own\nstderr -- the only thing that says WHY the launch failed -- is sitting in the\nsame `output` struct, two fields away, and the very next assertions already read\nit. This adds it to the failure message. The tests still fail; they now say\nsomething.\n\nTask: four-named-assertions-across-four-backends-are-what-keeps-main-red\n\nWHY NOW. Both DBT dispatch tests are failing on main today with exactly that\noutput. I could establish from the retained logs that the guest exits 255 having\ncompleted 0 syscalls with an empty thread tree in 8ms, and could NOT establish\nwhy, because the explanation was discarded at the assertion. Whoever fixes DBT\nneeds that text, and today they would have to re-run to get it.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT DO. It weakens nothing: the same condition fails, on the same\nline, with strictly more information. No assertion is relaxed, no tolerance\nwidened, no case skipped.\n\nTHE THREE SITES are the LiteInst, DBT and KVM dispatch tests, which share the\nshape. The fourth backend test, dbt_public_status_dispatch_runs_true_through_\ndetcore, is deliberately NOT changed: it calls `run_with_backend` rather than\n`run_with_output_backend` and receives only a status, so there is no stderr to\nreport and adding a message would only restate the numbers.\n\nDeterminism: no guest-visible behaviour changes; this touches test failure\nmessages only.\n\nLinux Semantics: unchanged.\n\nValidation: `cargo check --locked -p hermit --lib` and `--all-targets` both\nfinish clean. `rustfmt --edition 2024 --check hermit-cli/src/lib.rs` returns 0 --\nnote the crate is edition 2024, and checking it with `--edition 2021` reports\npre-existing let-chain errors that have nothing to do with this change.\n","created_at":"2026-09-17T08:03:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T08:03:13Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2f461a47fec3c5de8046856904c0d4faba8db787","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3058/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3058/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3058/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/612d06ab9d047ef0583e5e91d44a3a5e84d3c0f8","head":{"label":"rrnewton:recon-2/dbt-failure-diagnostics","ref":"recon-2/dbt-failure-diagnostics","sha":"612d06ab9d047ef0583e5e91d44a3a5e84d3c0f8","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":563646124,"node_id":"R_kgDOIZiOrA","name":"hermit","full_name":"rrnewton/hermit","private":false,"owner":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","orga